    - target: {fileID: 3144131112893328270, guid: c7b730decb8eadb4d86838ba48b53a91, type: 3}
      propertyPath: allSpells.Array.data[0].spellDescription
      value: The most basic spell every mage learns. Shoots a small burst of flame
        that burns on contact. Simple, reliable, and always hot.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3144131112893328270, guid: c7b730decb8eadb4d86838ba48b53a91, type: 3}
      propertyPath: allSpells.Array.data[1].spellDescription
      value: "A basic recovery spell that quickly restores a large portion of the
        caster\u2019s health, allowing them to recover from heavy injuries."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3144131112893328270, guid: c7b730decb8eadb4d86838ba48b53a91, type: 3}
      propertyPath: allSpells.Array.data[2].spellDescription
      value: A magical shield that covers the whole body making the caster immune
        to any damage.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3144131112893328270, guid: c7b730decb8eadb4d86838ba48b53a91, type: 3}
      propertyPath: allSpells.Array.data[3].spellDescription
      value: Unleashes a blazing arc of fire that cuts forward in a wide slash, scorching
        everything in its path with intense heat and fiery impact.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3144131112893328270, guid: c7b730decb8eadb4d86838ba48b53a91, type: 3}
      propertyPath: allSpells.Array.data[4].spellDescription
      value: Fires a high-pressure water spike that pierces through enemies from
        a distance.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3144131112893328270, guid: c7b730decb8eadb4d86838ba48b53a91, type: 3}
      propertyPath: allSpells.Array.data[5].spellDescription
      value: Launches a compressed blast of wind that deals light damage but powerfully
        knocks back enemies hit, disrupting their formation and balance.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3144131112893328270, guid: c7b730decb8eadb4d86838ba48b53a91, type: 3}
      propertyPath: allSpells.Array.data[6].spellDescription
      value: Fires a concentrated beam of lightning that travels at incredible speed,
        striking enemies from long range with pinpoint accuracy and devastating power.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3144131112893328270, guid: c7b730decb8eadb4d86838ba48b53a91, type: 3}
      propertyPath: allSpells.Array.data[7].spellDescription
      value: Launches a massive blazing orb that strikes with immense heat and force,
        dealing heavy fire damage on impact and boasting greater size and power than
        a regular fireball.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3144131112893328270, guid: c7b730decb8eadb4d86838ba48b53a91, type: 3}
      propertyPath: allSpells.Array.data[8].spellDescription
      value: Releases a surge of electricity field around the caster, stunning all
        nearby enemies with a jolt of energy while dealing minor damage.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3144131112893328270, guid: c7b730decb8eadb4d86838ba48b53a91, type: 3}
      propertyPath: allSpells.Array.data[9].spellDescription
      value: Summons a sturdy rock barrier that blocks enemy movement, standing firm
        for a short duration before crumbling away after its cooldown.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3144131112893328270, guid: c7b730decb8eadb4d86838ba48b53a91, type: 3}
      propertyPath: allSpells.Array.data[10].spellDescription
      value: Releases a brilliant wave of compressed electricity in a wide slash,
        crackling with energy and striking all enemies caught in its radiant path.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3144131112893328270, guid: c7b730decb8eadb4d86838ba48b53a91, type: 3}
      propertyPath: allSpells.Array.data[11].spellDescription
      value: Casts a compact electric bomb that detonates at short range, releasing
        a powerful shockwave that deals moderate damage and forcefully knocks enemies
        back.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3144131112893328270, guid: c7b730decb8eadb4d86838ba48b53a91, type: 3}
      propertyPath: allSpells.Array.data[12].spellDescription
      value: Fires a swift, condensed bolt of dark energy that travels quickly over
        a short distance, dealing small damage in it's trajectory.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3144131112893328270, guid: c7b730decb8eadb4d86838ba48b53a91, type: 3}
      propertyPath: allSpells.Array.data[13].spellDescription
      value: Triggers a massive close-range explosion that engulfs everything nearby,
        dealing heavy damage and violently knocking back all surrounding enemies.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3144131112893328270, guid: c7b730decb8eadb4d86838ba48b53a91, type: 3}
      propertyPath: allSpells.Array.data[14].spellDescription
      value: Summons spectral sharks that surge from the ground in a moderate area,
        tearing through enemies within range before fading back into the depths.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
